<title>USA: CCC buys 35,000T wheat for donation to Tajikistan.</title>
<headline>CCC buys 35,000T wheat for donation to Tajikistan.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp on July 9 will tender to buy 35,000 tonnes of hard red winter for donation to Tajikistan, CCC said.</p>
<p>Shipment was scheduled for July 23 to August 7.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
